      "extract": "[]{#sec:effT:2body label=\"sec:effT:2body\"} We write the leading order two-body effective potential in momentum space as: $$\\langle {\\bf p}|V|{\\bf q}\\rangle= \\langle {\\bf p}|g \\rangle \\lambda_2 \\langle g|{\\bf q} \\rangle ~, \\label{effpot_2}$$ where $\\lambda_2$ denotes the two-body coupling constant and ${\\bf q}$ (${\\bf p}$) are the relative three-momenta in the incoming (outgoing) channel. The regulator functions",
